hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15577","Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, from Shubah, he said: Mansur narrated to me, from Tamim ibn Salamah, from Ubayd ibn Khalid, and he was of the Companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: Sudden death is a seizure of wrath."
"15578","And he narrated it once from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"15579","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us: Shubah narrated to us, from Mansur, from Tamim ibn Salamah, from Ubayd ibn Khalid, a man of the Companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that he said concerning sudden death: A seizure of wrath."
